    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "> [!NOTE]\r\n> Inspired by [chrisgrieser/nvim-spider](https://github.com/chrisgrieser/nvim-spider).\r\n\r\nLet's define a textobject for selecting a subword:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal MiniAi = require(\"mini.ai\")\r\nMiniAi.setup({\r\n  mappings = {\r\n    -- Move forward\r\n    goto_left = \"g[\",\r\n    goto_right = \"g]\",\r\n  },\r\n  custom_textobjects = {\r\n    e = {\r\n      {\r\n        \"%f[%a]%l+%d*\",\r\n        \"%f[%w]%d+\",\r\n        \"%f[%u]%u%f[%A]%d*\",\r\n        \"%f[%u]%u%l+%d*\",\r\n        \"%f[%u]%u%u+%d*\",\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt could also be useful to jump backward between subwords:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \",e\", function() MiniAi.move_cursor(\"left\", \"a\", \"e\", { n_times = vim.v.count1 }) end, { desc = \"Next subword\" })\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \",E\", function() --[[ move backward ]], { desc = \"Prev subword\" })\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n|move_subword_next\r\n2,e\r\nmove_subword_|next\r\n,E\r\nmove_|subword_next\r\ncae [1]\r\nmove|_next\r\n```\r\n\r\n[1] See https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1434#discussioncomment-13238259",
    "bodyHTML": "<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-note\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-info mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z\"></path></svg>Note</p><p dir=\"auto\">Inspired by <a href=\"https://github.com/chrisgrieser/nvim-spider\">chrisgrieser/nvim-spider</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Let's define a textobject for selecting a subword:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local MiniAi = require(&quot;mini.ai&quot;)\nMiniAi.setup({\n  mappings = {\n    -- Move forward\n    goto_left = &quot;g[&quot;,\n    goto_right = &quot;g]&quot;,\n  },\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    e = {\n      {\n        &quot;%f[%a]%l+%d*&quot;,\n        &quot;%f[%w]%d+&quot;,\n        &quot;%f[%u]%u%f[%A]%d*&quot;,\n        &quot;%f[%u]%u%l+%d*&quot;,\n        &quot;%f[%u]%u%u+%d*&quot;,\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniAi</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>mini.ai<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniAi</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>({\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">mappings</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--</span> Move forward</span>\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">goto_left</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>g[<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">goto_right</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>g]<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n  },\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">custom_textobjects</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n    <span class=\"pl-smi\">e</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n      {\n        <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%f[%a]%l+%d*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%f[%w]%d+<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%f[%u]%u%f[%A]%d*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%f[%u]%u%l+%d*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,\n        <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>%f[%u]%u%u+%d*<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>,</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It could also be useful to jump backward between subwords:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.keymap.set(&quot;n&quot;, &quot;,e&quot;, function() MiniAi.move_cursor(&quot;left&quot;, &quot;a&quot;, &quot;e&quot;, { n_times = vim.v.count1 }) end, { desc = &quot;Next subword&quot; })\nvim.keymap.set(&quot;n&quot;, &quot;,E&quot;, function() --[[ move backward ]], { desc = &quot;Prev subword&quot; })\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>,e<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>() <span class=\"pl-smi\">MiniAi</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">move_cursor</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>left<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>a<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>e<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">n_times</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">v</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">count1</span> }) <span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Next subword<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">keymap</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">set</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>n<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>,E<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-k\">function</span>() <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">--[[</span> move backward <span class=\"pl-c\">]]</span></span>, { <span class=\"pl-smi\">desc</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Prev subword<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>})</pre></div>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"|move_subword_next\n2,e\nmove_subword_|next\n,E\nmove_|subword_next\ncae [1]\nmove|_next\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">|move_subword_next\n2,e\nmove_subword_|next\n,E\nmove_|subword_next\ncae [1]\nmove|_next\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">[1] See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"7748816\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1434\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1434/hovercard?comment_id=13238259\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1434#discussioncomment-13238259\">#1434 (comment)</a></p>",
    "bodyText": "NoteInspired by chrisgrieser/nvim-spider.\n\nLet's define a textobject for selecting a subword:\nlocal MiniAi = require(\"mini.ai\")\nMiniAi.setup({\n  mappings = {\n    -- Move forward\n    goto_left = \"g[\",\n    goto_right = \"g]\",\n  },\n  custom_textobjects = {\n    e = {\n      {\n        \"%f[%a]%l+%d*\",\n        \"%f[%w]%d+\",\n        \"%f[%u]%u%f[%A]%d*\",\n        \"%f[%u]%u%l+%d*\",\n        \"%f[%u]%u%u+%d*\",\nIt could also be useful to jump backward between subwords:\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \",e\", function() MiniAi.move_cursor(\"left\", \"a\", \"e\", { n_times = vim.v.count1 }) end, { desc = \"Next subword\" })\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \",E\", function() --[[ move backward ]], { desc = \"Prev subword\" })\n|move_subword_next\n2,e\nmove_subword_|next\n,E\nmove_|subword_next\ncae [1]\nmove|_next\n\n[1] See #1434 (comment)",
